| `toolchain.runner_images` | list of strings | `["ubuntu-24.04"]` | non-empty pinned image labels, none ending `-latest` | `tests/integration/test_toolchain_gate.py` | Lists every `runs-on` label a workflow job may use; a job with another label, a `-latest` label or no `runs-on` fails the gate test, and a list holding a `-latest` label is refused by the loader. Absent, the gate test reads the default and writes `[using default] toolchain.runner_images = ["ubuntu-24.04"]` to stderr. | the versions installed on the runner: `toolchain.node_major` and `toolchain.python` | always |
